{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“感觉谣言真的消失了呢。”", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，根本没有人在意了。”", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "sk3837", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果能就这样维持到休业式就好了……”", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“俗话说谣言只活７５０日。”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "sk3838", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那样或许会持续到樱乃毕业喔？”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那７．５日。”", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "sk3839", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……这次的确实有这种感觉。”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“太好了。因为……我讨厌别人批评葛格。”", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "sk3840", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也讨厌听到别人批评樱乃。”", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之可以安心了？”", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "sk3841", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不能太大意就是了。不过可以稍微放心了吧。”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……那重新开始撒娇也没关系呢。”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "sk3842", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸……？”", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这段时间她都没撒娇呢。", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……不行？”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "sk3843", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可以喔。但是如果又出现什么谣言就糟糕了，所以只在家里撒娇吧。”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯，暂时忍耐只在家里。”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "sk3844", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可以立刻来撒娇了吗？”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "sk3845", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，过来。”", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“打扰了。”", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "sk3846", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃轻巧地坐在我的腿上，身体靠着我。", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“跟葛格靠在一起好安心。”", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "sk3847", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“想要你摸我的头发。”", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "sk3848", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好──”", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“手机响了，等我一下喔。”", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "拿出手机，是隼太打来的。", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有什么事吗？", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喂。”", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘不好意思打扰你跟樱乃亲热啊。’", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "ht1211", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什……！？为、为什么你知道？”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘……抱歉，原来真的在亲热？那我等一下再打吧？’", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "ht1212", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……你问得实在太自然，吓了我一跳。”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没关系的，找我有什么事？”", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘好像打扰到你了我就长话短说吧。等一下各务台的男生们要集合办遗憾会。’", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "ht1213", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“合并试办终止的事？”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘就是这样。如果现在跟小樱乃在一起，不用勉强参加没关系……怎么样？’", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "ht1214", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这个嘛，难得大家聚会，我就稍微去一下吧。”", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "‘抱歉啊。’", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 399, "voice": "ht1215", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没关系，那我立刻准备出门。”", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "问好集合场所和时间，挂断电话。", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……你要出门吗？”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "sk3849", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“隼太他们要聚会，是合并终止的遗憾会。”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "sk3850", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她抱住我，头顶在我的胸口左右摇头。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“樱乃？”", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……因为补充了葛格，所以去一下没关系。”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "sk3851", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……抱歉，我会尽快回来的。”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯。”", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "sk3852", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“或许会赶不及晚饭时间，你先吃吧。”", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我知道了。”", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "sk3853", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我出门了。有什么事就打电话给我。”", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“有需要的话我１分钟打十次给你。”", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "sk3854", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……呃，我会接的打一次就好。”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“开玩笑的。”", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "sk3855", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“也对。而且樱乃以前也没有做过那种事。”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“真的有事情我会打给你。”", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "sk3856", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那我出门了。”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“慢走。”", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "sk3857", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route02_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……好像拖得有点晚。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
